{"unit_id":"PolinniZhong__dsh-session-workbench#caveat-2","repo":"PolinniZhong/dsh-session-workbench","commit":"991912d87ac4a1de040d4d10b76f6a3479d495b2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Session Workbench 的使用须知：代码的 Recent 列表直接读取本地会话列表，没有排除归档项；README 却称 Recent 默认排除归档会话，实际行为与文档不一致。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:783-810","README.md:103-109"]}
